  "limits": [
    "The fourteen-leaf loop and thirteen-leaf restoration are equational tracks. They include inverse eta and inverse association; they do not prove forward confluence or forward nontermination.",
    "These are derived comparisons of explicitly constructed paths, not comparisons of arbitrary normalization paths. The standard canonical tensor normalization square and its actual atomic witnesses remain unconstructed.",
    "The current full eighteen-root and mixed catalogue still lacks a complete finite higher basis and arbitrary branching coverage.",
    "Rewrite-leaf counts exclude higher proof constructors, contexts and wire payloads, certificate bytes and checker runtime. No fair total-cost compression advantage or mathematical novelty is established.",
    "Repaired joint semantics remains inside one updated checked model. No new code-changing reduction, loss/time/resource guarantee or complete physical oracle/keygen execution is supplied. Unregistered NativeConfiguredMAC integration remains excluded.",
    "No new external primary-source reading or independent review occurred. The existing primary-source novelty limits remain in force."
  ],
